{"seq":1,"slug":"mathematics","title":"数学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mathematics","introMarkdown":"# 数学 简介\n\n大学数学是从高中数学的计算技巧走向抽象思维和严格证明的质的跨越。在这里，数学不再只是解方程和算积分的工具，而是一套以公理、定义和逻辑推理为基础构建起来的思想体系。从实数的完备性到群的抽象结构，从欧几里得空间到拓扑流形，大学数学逐步揭示了隐藏在具体计算背后的深层规律和统一框架。\n\n自学者进入大学数学时面临的最大转变是从\"做题\"到\"证明\"的思维跃迁。高中数学关注的是找到正确答案，大学数学则要求你理解为什么某个命题为真，并用严格的逻辑链条证明它。这种转变初期可能令人沮丧，但一旦建立起证明的直觉和技巧，你会发现数学之美恰恰在于这种精确与优雅的统一。\n\n第一章**数学分析**从极限和连续性出发，建立微积分的严格理论基础，进而拓展到复分析和泛函分析等更抽象的分析框架。第二章**代数学**从群、环、域等代数结构入手，探索抽象代数的世界，同时深化线性代数的理论维度和数论的迷人问题。第三章**几何与拓扑**突破欧几里得几何的限制，进入曲面上的微分几何和更一般的拓扑空间，研究形状和连续性的本质。第四章**应用数学**关注数学方法在科学计算、最优化和建模中的实际运用。\n\n建议从数学分析和线性代数这两门基础课程开始，它们是几乎所有数学分支的起点。学习时坚持自己动手证明每一个定理，即使过程缓慢，也远比被动阅读有效。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"analysis","title":"数学分析","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mathematics/analysis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"real-analysis","title":"实分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mathematics/analysis/real-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"complex-analysis","title":"复分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mathematics/analysis/complex-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"functional-analysis","title":"泛函分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mathematics/analysis/functional-analysis"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"algebra","title":"代数学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mathematics/algebra","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"abstract-algebra","title":"抽象代数","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mathematics/algebra/abstract-algebra"},{"seq":2,"slug":"linear-algebra-advanced","title":"高等线性代数","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mathematics/algebra/linear-algebra-advanced"},{"seq":3,"slug":"number-theory","title":"数论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mathematics/algebra/number-theory"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"geometry-topology","title":"几何与拓扑","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mathematics/geometry-topology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"differential-geometry","title":"微分几何","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mathematics/geometry-topology/differential-geometry"},{"seq":2,"slug":"algebraic-topology","title":"代数拓扑","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mathematics/geometry-topology/algebraic-topology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"manifold-theory","title":"流形理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mathematics/geometry-topology/manifold-theory"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applied-mathematics","title":"应用数学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mathematics/applied-mathematics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"numerical-methods","title":"数值方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mathematics/applied-mathematics/numerical-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"optimization-theory","title":"最优化理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mathematics/applied-mathematics/optimization-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mathematical-modeling","title":"数学建模","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/mathematics/applied-mathematics/mathematical-modeling"}]}]}